<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ manufacturers sales rise 0.6 pct in Sept year.</title>
<headline>NZ manufacturers sales rise 0.6 pct in Sept year.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manufacturers sales increased 0.6 percent to $11.9 billion in the Setpmeber quarter from $11.8 billion in the year ago quarter, Statistics New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
</text>
